>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Tim. I spend my time around data and code, and I like tinkering with new things. This is
		my notebook — a place to jot down whatever I'm learning or thinking about.
	</p>
	<p>
		I'm not going for polished or expert; a lot of this I'm still figuring out. I write it down
		partly to keep a record for myself, and partly in case it happens to help someone passing by.
	</p>
	<p>Prefer Chinese? See the <a href="/about">中文版</a>.</p>
</Layout>
